# Environment Variables — Customer App

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# RAZORPAY PAYMENT GATEWAY
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Get this from: https://dashboard.razorpay.com → Settings → API Keys
# Use rzp_test_XXXX for test mode, rzp_live_XXXX for production.
# NOTE: Only the KEY ID goes here (public key). The KEY SECRET is set as a
#       Supabase secret (see README for instructions).
VITE_RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
